# LF in the repository for everything textual.
#
# Not cosmetic here: DDL delimits blocks by indentation, so a line-ending
# change does not raise a syntax error -- it changes which block a statement
# belongs to. The compiler accepts CRLF, and there is a test proving CRLF and
# LF produce identical Verilog, but the sources stay LF regardless.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.fs binary
